cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Auracelle Charlie in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Auracelle Charlie v6.0: AI Governance War Game Simulation Sandbox"
version: "6.0"
date-released: "2026-05-27"
abstract: >
  Auracelle Charlie is a structured wargaming instrument for stress-testing AI governance
  policy using the E-AGPO-HT v3.1 (Evaluative Agentic Governance Policy Optimisation —
  Hybrid Taxonomy) framework. Participants negotiate real-world AI governance scenarios
  through six adversarial rounds with AI agents, automated Red Team shocks, and a Policy
  Owner agent. The instrument generates structured RL-ready research data for doctoral
  analysis at Bath Spa University.
